                                "example_id": "27fa90eb-302b-4631-b50a-5d1ecb44249e",
                                "sense_id": "4a607e64-679d-3567-8701-5c723acc9e49",
                                "text": "Other young women in Paris—fellow-members there of the little tight transpontine world of art-study—professed to know that the pair had been \"several times\" over so closely contracted."
