                                "sense_id": "e87a24cb-b9bf-3568-8128-5719dfbfe4f4",
                                "text": "Such transpontine spectacles are not usually seen in our local theatre."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5f0226f-395c-49ec-a2d0-65fb5539dd04",
                                "sense_id": "e87a24cb-b9bf-3568-8128-5719dfbfe4f4",
                                "text": "Blood and thunder melodrama was once transpontine : it is now cispontine. It has crossed the Thames, and come over the bridges."
